  "instructions": "Drain the aquafaba from canned chickpeas. Add some garlic powder and chilly powder. Mix well. Arrange chickpeas in a single layer in a pan for roasting. Roast at 400 F. Stir and check every 20 minutes. It took me about an hour for chickpeas to get completely roasted.",
